The files anime-restorer/vendor/models/*.param are the ncnn network
descriptions of the Real-ESRGAN models (realesr-animevideov3 x2/x3/x4,
realesrgan-x4plus, realesrgan-x4plus-anime), as shipped in
realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan-20220424-windows.zip from Real-ESRGAN release v0.2.5.0.
They are unchanged. The full licence text is in
anime-restorer/vendor/models/LICENSE.

The matching weight files (*.bin) and the realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan program are
not part of this repository; they come from the same release archive. The
realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan program is published under the MIT License
(https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN-ncnn-vulkan).

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code written for Video Studio only.
